### Acknowledgment
Some transformation rules in *FunnyFrench* were inspired by Sean Patrick Payne’s *Fake French Accent Translator* (2014).
Original sources:
- Blog post: https://www.payneful.co.uk/blogsplosion/2014/11/16/so-i-built-a-fake-french-accent-translator/
- GitHub: https://github.com/SPPayne/fake_french_accent_translator
